@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000

### Create a player
POST {{baseUrl}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "score": 10
}

### Get all players
GET {{baseUrl}}/players

### Get player by id (change 1 to a real id from the create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/1

### Create a wallet for that player
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "initialBalance": 100
}

### Get wallet by id (change 1 to a real id from the create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/1

### Deposit funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "EUR",
  "amount": 50
}

### Get wallet again — should reflect the updated balance, and should be a cache HIT
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/1

### Get non-existent wallet — should be 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/9999